167
00:11:38,333 --> 00:11:43,025
Steering has limits. The injection coefficient cannot be increased indefinitely.

168
00:11:43,125 --> 00:11:46,079
Middle layers tend to work best. It needs access to

169
00:11:46,179 --> 00:11:50,272
the model's internals: ActAdd is not immediately applicable given only

170
00:11:50,372 --> 00:11:53,327
API access to a model. And Tan and colleagues found

171
00:11:53,427 --> 00:11:57,580
