175
00:12:10,945 --> 00:12:15,534
reads and controls such directions. Directional ablation removes a direction:

176
00:12:15,634 --> 00:12:18,518
subtract from x its projection, r hat dot x times

177
00:12:18,618 --> 00:12:21,075
r hat, the part of x along the unit vector

178
00:12:21,175 --> 00:12:24,546
r hat. Arditi and colleagues found refusal is mediated by

179
00:12:24,646 --> 00:12:29,113
a one-dimensional subspace: a single direction. And Anthropic's Golden Gate

180
00:12:29,213 --> 00:12:32,584
Claude fixed one learned feature, a direction tied to the

181
00:12:32,684 --> 00:12:34,777
Golden Gate Bridge, at a high value.

182
00:12:36,366 --> 00:12:41,096
The two lines again, and now every symbol has a meaning. The steering vector

183
00:12:41,196 --> 00:12:44,211
v sub ell is an element of R d. D is a finite set

184
00:12:44,311 --> 00:12:48,660
of triples; its size is a whole number. Each triple holds a prompt and

185
00:12:48,760 --> 00:12:53,491
two completions, and a sub ell gives their activation at layer ell. Below, h

186
00:12:53,591 --> 00:12:57,750
is the residual stream at layer ell and position t, alpha is a real

187
00:12:57,850 --> 00:13:00,674
scalar, and T is the set of positions we edit.

188
00:13:00,766 --> 00:13:03,989
Build a direction by contrasting examples, then add it while

189
00:13:04,089 --> 00:13:07,090
the model runs. That is a steering vector. Every source,

190
00:13:07,190 --> 00:13:10,026
